From 8de5950c70b48daadef11f910eece0b7863db79b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yang Tsao <yang@fydeos.io>
Date: Wed, 15 Apr 2026 15:29:54 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] bionic: ignore fsetxattr_failed in
 __system_property_area_init
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

In a container environment (ARC++ / fydroid-rt), the CrOS host kernel's
SELinux policy doesn't include all AOSP property context types. This causes
fsetxattr(security.selinux) to fail for unknown contexts, even in
permissive mode, because the kernel still validates context strings.

The property areas are created and mapped correctly regardless — only the
SELinux xattr labels on the property files are wrong. Since the container
runs with SELinux permissive, this is harmless.

Without this change, __system_property_area_init() returns -1 and init
aborts with 'Failed to initialize property area'.

Change-Id: Iffddef5fcd8b4197acc22822b094e67e2b063574
---
 libc/bionic/system_property_api.cpp | 7 ++++++-
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/libc/bionic/system_property_api.cpp b/libc/bionic/system_property_api.cpp
index a641f12a8..0bd829ddd 100644
--- a/libc/bionic/system_property_api.cpp
+++ b/libc/bionic/system_property_api.cpp
@@ -56,7 +56,12 @@ int __system_property_set_filename(const char*) {
 __BIONIC_WEAK_FOR_NATIVE_BRIDGE
 int __system_property_area_init() {
   bool fsetxattr_failed = false;
-  return system_properties.AreaInit(PROP_FILENAME, &fsetxattr_failed) && !fsetxattr_failed ? 0 : -1;
+  // fydroid-rt: ignore fsetxattr_failed — the CrOS host kernel's SELinux policy
+  // doesn't include all AOSP property context types, so fsetxattr(security.selinux)
+  // fails for unknown contexts even in permissive mode.  The property areas are
+  // still created and mapped correctly; only the SELinux xattr labels are wrong,
+  // which is harmless when SELinux is permissive.
+  return system_properties.AreaInit(PROP_FILENAME, &fsetxattr_failed) ? 0 : -1;
 }
 
 __BIONIC_WEAK_FOR_NATIVE_BRIDGE
-- 
2.43.0

